{"id":"ef593f4bf65d6fd1","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-kaplansky-density.md","title":"Kaplansky Density Theorem","display":"thm-kaplansky-density — Kaplansky Density Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-kaplansky-density","aliases":["58-thm-kaplansky-density"],"display":"thm-kaplansky-density — Kaplansky Density Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-von-neumann-algebra.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-strong-operator.md]]","[[58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-kaplansky-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-kaplansky-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kaplansky-density — Kaplansky Density Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f82bb5282bf6867\" href=\"?note=9f82bb5282bf6867\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-von-neumann-algebra.md\">../batch03/58-df-von-neumann-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c0f65843385cfcf5\" href=\"?note=c0f65843385cfcf5\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-strong-operator.md\">../batch14/58-df-strong-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2191f28be68a0b41\" href=\"?note=2191f28be68a0b41\" title=\"58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md\">58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,\\mathcal H)\">\\(\\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,\\mathcal H)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;&#39;\">\\(A&#39;&#39;\\)</span> 与算子范数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|T\\|\">\\(\\|T\\|\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2191f28be68a0b41\" href=\"?note=2191f28be68a0b41\" title=\"./58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md\">58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md</a> 的同一 Hilbert 结构。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,M\\in V\">\\(A,M\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c0f65843385cfcf5\" href=\"?note=c0f65843385cfcf5\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-strong-operator.md\">../batch14/58-df-strong-operator.md</a>。该定义中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,k,+_H,\\odot_H\">\\(B,k,+_H,\\odot_H\\)</span> 分别指定为本条的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\">\\(B,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\bullet\">\\(T_\\bullet\\)</span> 是集合编码的网；指标集和定向关系由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S\\)</span> 中的量词绑定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kaplansky} \\vdash \\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,\\mathcal H)\\land M=A&#39;&#39;\\to\\forall T\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\\;\\Bigl(T\\in M\\leftrightarrow\\exists T_\\bullet\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(T_\\bullet)\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S(T_\\bullet,T,\\mathcal H))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kaplansky} \\vdash \\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,\\mathcal H)\\land M=A&#39;&#39;\\to\\forall T\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\\;\\Bigl(T\\in M\\leftrightarrow\\exists T_\\bullet\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(T_\\bullet)\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S(T_\\bullet,T,\\mathcal H))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kaplansky} \\vdash \\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,\\mathcal H)\\land M=A&#39;&#39;\\to\\forall T\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\\;\\Bigl(T\\in M\\land\\|T\\|\\leq1\\leftrightarrow\\exists T_\\bullet\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(T_\\bullet)\\subseteq\\{a\\in A:\\|a\\|\\leq1\\}\\land\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S(T_\\bullet,T,\\mathcal H))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kaplansky} \\vdash \\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,\\mathcal H)\\land M=A&#39;&#39;\\to\\forall T\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\\;\\Bigl(T\\in M\\land\\|T\\|\\leq1\\leftrightarrow\\exists T_\\bullet\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(T_\\bullet)\\subseteq\\{a\\in A:\\|a\\|\\leq1\\}\\land\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S(T_\\bullet,T,\\mathcal H))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first line is the bicommutant-density statement; the second is Kaplansky's norm-controlled strengthening. SOT closure membership is expanded as the existence of a set-coded convergent net whose range lies in the relevant subset.</li>\n<li>The star-subalgebra predicate receives the Hilbert carrier required by its source; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(\\mathcal H)\">\\(B(\\mathcal H)\\)</span> is already reconstructed inside that definition.</li>\n<li>The corresponding self-adjoint density statement requires restricting both sides to self-adjoint elements.</li>\n<li>Fundamental tool for approximating von Neumann algebra elements.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-von-neumann-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f82bb5282bf6867","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-von-neumann-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-strong-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"c0f65843385cfcf5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-strong-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"2191f28be68a0b41","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"2191f28be68a0b41","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})$。$\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)$、$\\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,\\mathcal H)$、$A'$、$A''$ 与算子范数 $\\|T\\|$ 使用 [[./58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md]] 的同一 Hilbert 结构。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-strong-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"c0f65843385cfcf5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,M\\in V$；$\\mathrm{SOTConv}_S$ 使用 [[../batch14/58-df-strong-operator.md]]。该定义中的 $B,k,+_H,\\odot_H$ 分别指定为本条的 $B,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,\\mathcal H)","display":false},{"tex":"A'","display":false},{"tex":"A''","display":false},{"tex":"\\|